Fastfetch and adaptations of its existing files retain upstream MIT terms
in LICENSE. Bundled yyjson is unchanged; its complete MIT notice is retained
in the staged yyjson.h header.

Original Pyxis native adapters, bounded CMake build, recipe and project ASCII
logo use MPL-2.0, included alongside this notice. The owner supplied the logo
as /shared/pyxis-logo/logo; its bytes are unchanged. PNG/SVG artwork is not used.

The patches select SDK interfaces, ten modules and one-shot text/JSON output.
Upstream formatting, containers, allocation and diagnostic behavior are retained.
See the recipe README for supported facilities and native observations.
